= Arthur Crispien

Crispien is a former leader of the USPD who was expelled over his opposition to the merger between the USPD and KPD.

- @left_unity
- @kpd_cooperation
- @campaign_pacifism
- @root: Return to main

@left_unity
title: Left-Center Unity
subtitle: Encourage cooperation between the left and center wings of the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 10; labor_dissent -= 5; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5

We have reduced dissent among the party's factions.

@kpd_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the KPD
subtitle: Any cooperation between the parties requires compromise from the KPD as well as the SPD.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 5; kpd_relation += 6*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 3; communist_coalition += 1 if kpd_cooperation_seen <= 1; kpd_cooperation_seen += 1

Levi attempts to reach out to his former colleagues to dissuade the KPD from their current extreme Stalinist path. Some concessions are extracted.
